{"sha": "26ac99102232d27e3666e6fad4286ad84440b41ecc68f5b5151f324b74e095e2", "body": ["{\\small 将燃烧匙伸入盛有氧气的集气瓶中，发光的木炭", "剧烈燃烧：碳与氧气反应生成二氧化碳。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[钢丝绒]\\label{ex:g7:chemical-reactions:steel-wool}", "一团细钢丝绒，主要成分是铁，在空气中燃烧时可以", "迸射出火星。反应物是铁和氧气；生成物是", "一种深色、易碎的固体，即氧化铁。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.5\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g7-steel-wool-burning.jpg}", "", "{\\small 钢丝绒在实验室中燃烧：铁与氧气发生反应。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{文字表达式}", "", "\\begin{definition}[文字表达式]\\label{def:g7:chemical-reactions:word-equation}", "\\emph{文字表达式}\\index{文字表达式}用文字表示化学反应，", "即在左边写出反应物的名称，并用 $+$ 连接，", "再用箭头连接，右边写出生成物的名称。箭头读作", "“反应生成”。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[三个文字表达式]\\label{ex:g7:chemical-reactions:three}", "\\begin{center}", "\\begin{tabular}{l}", "碳 $+$ 氧气 $\\longrightarrow$ 二氧化碳\\\\[2pt]", "甲烷 $+$ 氧气 $\\longrightarrow$ 二氧化碳 $+$ 水\\\\[2pt]", "铁 $+$ 氧气 $\\longrightarrow$ 氧化铁", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[书写文字表达式]\\label{met:g7:chemical-reactions:write}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 找出反应物：即消失的物质。", "  \\item 找出生成物：即新生成的物质，通过检验加以确认。", "  \\item 反应物写在左边，生成物写在右边，", "        中间用箭头连接，切勿使用等号。", "\\end{enumerate}", "存在但不参与反应的物质 --- 如火焰周围空气中的氮气 ---", "不必写出。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{反应是原子的重新排列}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[原子被重新排列]\\label{prop:g7:chemical-reactions:rearranged}", "在化学反应中，反应物的分子被拆散，", "原子以不同的方式重新结合，构成", "生成物的分子。原子本身既不会产生，也不会消失：", "同样的原子，数目相同，反应前后都存在。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{example}[甲烷燃烧的分子变化]\\label{ex:g7:chemical-reactions:methane}", "燃气灶中的甲烷燃烧时，一个甲烷分子 \\ce{CH4}", "与两个氧分子 \\ce{O2} 相遇，它们的原子重新排列，生成一个", "二氧化碳分子 \\ce{CO2} 和两个水分子 \\ce{H2O}。", "反应前：1 个碳原子、4 个氢原子和 4 个氧原子。反应后：1 个碳原子、4", "个氢原子，以及 $2 + 2 = 4$ 个氧原子。没有原子损失，也没有", "凭空出现。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % methane", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=0cm]", "    \\node[aC] (c) at (0,0) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h1) at (0,0.78) {}; \\node[aH] (h2) at (-0.74,-0.3) {};", "    \\node[aH] (h3) at (0.74,-0.3) {}; \\node[aH] (h4) at (0.2,-0.68) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\foreach \\h in {h1,h2,h3,h4} \\draw[bond] (c.center) -- (\\h.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node at (0,-1.2) {1 甲烷};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node at (1.45,0) {$+$};", "  % two oxygen molecules", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.45,-0.45} {", "    \\node[aO] (a) at (2.4,\\y) {}; \\node[aO] (b) at (3.05,\\y) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=1.6pt]a.center) -- ([yshift=1.6pt]b.center);", "      \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=-1.6pt]a.center) -- ([yshift=-1.6pt]b.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "  }", "  \\node at (2.72,-1.2) {2 氧气};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (3.8,0) -- (5.0,0);", "  % carbon dioxide", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.3cm]", "    \\node[aO] (a) at (-0.8,0) {}; \\node[aC] (c) at (0,0) {}; \\node[aO] (b) at (0.8,0) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\foreach \\d in {-1.6,1.6} {", "        \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=\\d pt]a.center) -- ([yshift=\\d pt]c.center);", "        \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=\\d pt]c.center) -- ([yshift=\\d pt]b.center);}", "    \\end{scope}", "    \\node at (0,-1.2) {1 二氧化碳};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\node at (7.8,0) {$+$};", "  % two water molecules", "  \\foreach \\x in {8.9,10.6} {", "    \\node[aO] (o) at (\\x,0.2) {};", "    \\node[aH] (p) at (\\x-0.58,-0.25) {}; \\node[aH] (q) at (\\x+0.58,-0.25) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (p.center); \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (q.center);", "    \\end{scope}", "  }", "  \\node at (9.75,-1.2) {2 水};", "  % atom counts", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.5,-2.0) {反应前：1 C，4 H，4 O};", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (8.5,-2.0) {反应后：1 C，4 H，4 O};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}